OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fcloudy but mainly dry evening.
OL,7,FRemaining cloudy overnight with a few
OL,8,Fshowers developing, mainly over Orkney
OL,9,Flater. Brisk northwesterly winds
OL,10,Feasing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mixture of bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells and a few brief light showers.
OL,14,FLight northwesterly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,17,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,18,FSunday. Dry with long sunny spells
OL,19,Fgoing into early next week.
